@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle folder

skinparam package {
  backgroundColor #FFFFFF
  borderColor #000000
  borderThickness 1.2
  fontColor #000000
  fontSize 13
}

skinparam arrow {
  color #000000
  thickness 1.0
}

' ==============================================================================
' TẦNG 1 (TRÊN CÙNG): Client Aggregators & Notification
' ==============================================================================
together {
  package progress
  package notification
}

' ==============================================================================
' TẦNG 2: Business Core Modules
' ==============================================================================
together {
  package discovery
  package payment
  package review
  package verification
  package scheduling
}

' ==============================================================================
' TẦNG 3: Mediation & Class Contract
' ==============================================================================
together {
  package connection
}

' ==============================================================================
' TẦNG 4: Identity & Profile Core
' ==============================================================================
together {
  package profile
  package iam
}

' ==============================================================================
' TẦNG 5 (NỀN TẢNG): Platform Services & Infrastructure
' ==============================================================================
together {
  package ai
  package storage
  package audit
  package shared
}

' ==============================================================================
' RÀNG BUỘC BỐ CỤC PHÂN TẦNG (TOP-TO-BOTTOM & LEFT-TO-RIGHT)
' ==============================================================================
progress -[hidden]down-> discovery
discovery -[hidden]down-> connection
connection -[hidden]down-> profile
profile -[hidden]down-> ai

progress -[hidden]right-> notification

discovery -[hidden]right-> payment
payment -[hidden]right-> review
review -[hidden]right-> verification
verification -[hidden]right-> scheduling

profile -[hidden]right-> iam

ai -[hidden]right-> storage
storage -[hidden]right-> audit
audit -[hidden]right-> shared

' ==============================================================================
' CÁC QUAN HỆ PHỤ THUỘC («use» - 42 MŨI TÊN NÉT ĐỨT ĐẦU HỞ ..>)
' ==============================================================================

' --- Phụ thuộc nội bộ Tầng 2 ---
payment ..> scheduling
review ..> scheduling

' --- Tầng 1: progress (6 quan hệ) ---
progress ..> profile
progress ..> scheduling
progress ..> connection
progress ..> ai
progress ..> iam
progress ..> shared

' --- Tầng 1: notification (7 quan hệ) ---
notification ..> scheduling
notification ..> connection
notification ..> profile
notification ..> review
notification ..> payment
notification ..> iam
notification ..> shared

' --- Tầng 2: discovery (4 quan hệ) ---
discovery ..> profile
discovery ..> connection
discovery ..> ai
discovery ..> shared

' --- Tầng 2: payment (4 quan hệ) ---
payment ..> connection
payment ..> profile
payment ..> shared

' --- Tầng 2: review (5 quan hệ) ---
review ..> connection
review ..> profile
review ..> iam
review ..> shared

' --- Tầng 2: verification (4 quan hệ) ---
verification ..> profile
verification ..> iam
verification ..> storage
verification ..> shared

' --- Tầng 2: scheduling (3 quan hệ) ---
scheduling ..> connection
scheduling ..> profile
scheduling ..> shared

' --- Tầng 3: connection (3 quan hệ) ---
connection ..> profile
connection ..> iam
connection ..> shared

' --- Tầng 4: profile (2 quan hệ) ---
profile ..> ai
profile ..> shared

' --- Tầng 4: iam (1 quan hệ) ---
iam ..> shared

' --- Tầng 5: ai, storage, audit (3 quan hệ đến shared) ---
ai ..> shared
storage ..> shared
audit ..> shared

' ==============================================================================
' CHÚ THÍCH KIẾN TRÚC
' ==============================================================================
footer
<b>Ghi chú kiến trúc EduFit Modular Monolith:</b>
* Chiều phụ thuộc đơn hướng từ tầng trên xuống tầng dưới (hoặc sang phải đến shared), không có chu trình phụ thuộc (Acyclic Dependencies Principle - ADP).
* Module <b>notification</b> ở tầng trên cùng, tuyệt đối không có mũi tên nào từ module khác đi vào notification.
* Các module nghiệp vụ chỉ tương tác chéo thông qua package con public <b>api</b> của module đích (ArchUnit Enforced).
end footer

@enduml